@startuml
title Citizen aid request - baseline + SRS proposal
actor Citizen
participant "PWA Client" as Client
participant "Need API" as API
participant "Request Service" as Needs
database PostgreSQL as DB
participant "Triage (SRS proposed)" as Triage
Citizen -> Client: Open form / allow GPS or use manual pin
Citizen -> Client: Enter need items and submit
Client -> API: POST /need-requests (Idempotency-Key)
API -> Needs: Validate location and PII
Needs -> DB: INSERT aid_request + request lines (transaction)
DB --> Needs: request ID / PENDING_VERIFICATION
opt SRS extension - not in current API
Needs -> Triage: Score urgency and check duplicates
Triage --> Needs: Proposed priority / duplicate cluster
end
Needs --> API: Created receipt
API --> Client: 201 (PII masked)
Client --> Citizen: Confirmation (tracking PIN proposed)
@enduml
